CoPlan 3.1 — a smoother, more modern feel.
• Screens now glide instead of snap: animated page transitions, smooth tab switching, and expenses that expand from their card into the detail view.
• The calendar slides in the direction you navigate, and the day panel cross-fades when you pick a different day.
• Schedule cards cascade in gently, loading screens show content-shaped placeholders instead of a spinner, and your net balance counts up to its value.
• Bottom sheets gained drag handles. All motion is quick (under a third of a second) and respects your phone's reduce-motion setting.
